(6376158, 944829, 30712, '<td valign="top">What a difficult subject.  It''s been very educational for me in the UK in terms of learning American speak.  We call this squirrel food a crisp.  Fantastic picture anyway and by far the most interesting.</td>', 'What a difficult subject.  It''s been very educational for me in the UK in terms of learning American speak.  We call this squirrel food a crisp.  Fantastic picture anyway and by far the most interesting.', '2011-04-06 05:32:31.000000', NULL, 1),
