(6376219, 944485, 49954, '<td valign="top">Hate the yin-yang symbol in general (there is not good in evil and evil in good -- God is good and there is no evil in Him).  However, subject aside, this will ribbon.  Lots of setup and well shot.  The dark chips are a little too dark, but otherwise, nice lighting too.</td>', 'Hate the yin-yang symbol in general (there is not good in evil and evil in good -- God is good and there is no evil in Him).  However, subject aside, this will ribbon.  Lots of setup and well shot.  The dark chips are a little too dark, but otherwise, nice lighting too.', '2011-04-06 08:27:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6376220, 944882, 49954, '<td valign="top">Those are shavings not chips...  Well shot.</td>', 'Those are shavings not chips...  Well shot.', '2011-04-06 08:28:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6376221, 944891, 49954, '<td valign="top">Chips aren''t the focus, but the kiss</td>', 'Chips aren''t the focus, but the kiss', '2011-04-06 08:29:10.000000', NULL, 1),
