(6376481, 944891, 124256, '<td valign="top">I like the idea a lot.  The angle, composition, and focus aren''t resonating with me though.  I wonder if it would work better if we saw the famous chip more from the point of view of the little chips so it looked more impressive?  Also it seems like maybe the little chips should be in focus with the subject of their ambition out of focus in the background, as of yet unrealized.</td>', 'I like the idea a lot.  The angle, composition, and focus aren''t resonating with me though.  I wonder if it would work better if we saw the famous chip more from the point of view of the little chips so it looked more impressive?  Also it seems like maybe the little chips should be in focus with the subject of their ambition out of focus in the background, as of yet unrealized.', '2011-04-06 12:51:14.000000', NULL, 1),
