(6377261, 944474, 124256, '<td valign="top">I love this shot.  The chip is the focal point, the star.  The gull is coming in, out of focus not yet a factor, but soon to be.  I love the angle, and that the tilt gives us the gull''s point of view (in reverse) -- and this in turn draws more focus back to the chip.  Awesome!</td>', 'I love this shot.  The chip is the focal point, the star.  The gull is coming in, out of focus not yet a factor, but soon to be.  I love the angle, and that the tilt gives us the gull''s point of view (in reverse) -- and this in turn draws more focus back to the chip.  Awesome!', '2011-04-06 22:48:42.000000', NULL, 1),
