(6383740, 944857, 124256, '<td valign="top">I looks nice but doesn''t pop or say anything to me.  Not the easiest subject.</td>', 'I looks nice but doesn''t pop or say anything to me.  Not the easiest subject.', '2011-04-12 12:44:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6383742, 944680, 69034, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of the film "Runaway".  Good Idea, Nice lighting and setup.</td>', 'Reminds me of the film "Runaway".  Good Idea, Nice lighting and setup.', '2011-04-12 12:46:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6383744, 944602, 124256, '<td valign="top">I like it!  The cart does seem a little out of place outside on the grass there -- it seems like it should have some water damage from being out there.  That said, the details of the chipping paint are great, and I love what the potted flower adds to the shot.</td>', 'I like it!  The cart does seem a little out of place outside on the grass there -- it seems like it should have some water damage from being out there.  That said, the details of the chipping paint are great, and I love what the potted flower adds to the shot.', '2011-04-12 12:51:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6383747, 944684, 124256, '<td valign="top">I love your idea, and the title makes it even better!  I think actually getting some dip on a chip would help sell it even more.  In fact this shot makes me long to see a drip of the dip dropping off of a chip.</td>', 'I love your idea, and the title makes it even better!  I think actually getting some dip on a chip would help sell it even more.  In fact this shot makes me long to see a drip of the dip dropping off of a chip.', '2011-04-12 12:55:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6383758, 944874, 124256, '<td valign="top">The chip case is fantastic!  Still, there was something about this shot that really bothered me.  Finally, I think I figured out that the chair in the background really detracts.  The case, the chips, lady luck, everything seems great, vintage-y, even somewhat timeless.  The chair in the background really detracts and doesn''t fit at all.  I think I noticed it right away subconsciously.  Tighter crop or different angle removing the chair, or adding a dropcloth blocking the chair I think would really help.</td>', 'The chip case is fantastic!  Still, there was something about this shot that really bothered me.  Finally, I think I figured out that the chair in the background really detracts.  The case, the chips, lady luck, everything seems great, vintage-y, even somewhat timeless.  The chair in the background really detracts and doesn''t fit at all.  I think I noticed it right away subconsciously.  Tighter crop or different angle removing the chair, or adding a dropcloth blocking the chair I think would really help.', '2011-04-12 13:21:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6383760, 944858, 124256, '<td valign="top">::Sigh:: They never look like this when I''m cooking them.  I love the uniform spatter of drops in and out of focus.</td>', '::Sigh:: They never look like this when I''m cooking them.  I love the uniform spatter of drops in and out of focus.', '2011-04-12 13:22:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6383764, 944826, 96751, '<td valign="top">Poor guy</td>', 'Poor guy', '2011-04-12 13:23:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6383765, 944680, 96751, '<td valign="top">LOL!  Wonderful personification.  A bit more contrast and this would have been stellar.</td>', 'LOL!  Wonderful personification.  A bit more contrast and this would have been stellar.', '2011-04-12 13:23:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6383767, 944846, 124256, '<td valign="top">Great idea!  I especially like your reference to the score in the title.  I feel like the shot should either be more bright, flashy, and commercial looking -- or more antique-y and dramatic looking.  As it is, I don''t think it pops not going in any particular direction.</td>', 'Great idea!  I especially like your reference to the score in the title.  I feel like the shot should either be more bright, flashy, and commercial looking -- or more antique-y and dramatic looking.  As it is, I don''t think it pops not going in any particular direction.', '2011-04-12 13:24:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6383768, 944872, 96751, '<td valign="top">You''ve got some mean fringing going on.  Really easy to fix, even in basic.  Nice idea, though.</td>', 'You''ve got some mean fringing going on.  Really easy to fix, even in basic.  Nice idea, though.', '2011-04-12 13:24:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6383772, 944662, 96751, '<td valign="top">I''m frustrated by this image because I never would have thought of paint chips (VERY clever), but I feel that there could have been much more imaginative ways to use them.  Also, the lighting just does not work for me - it''s a bit flat and murky.  So, split feeling about this.</td>', 'I''m frustrated by this image because I never would have thought of paint chips (VERY clever), but I feel that there could have been much more imaginative ways to use them.  Also, the lighting just does not work for me - it''s a bit flat and murky.  So, split feeling about this.', '2011-04-12 13:25:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6383773, 944846, 96751, '<td valign="top">My favorite game!  Very clever.  A bit of a yellow cast, which dulls the image, but the lighting is lovely.</td>', 'My favorite game!  Very clever.  A bit of a yellow cast, which dulls the image, but the lighting is lovely.', '2011-04-12 13:26:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6383774, 944613, 124256, '<td valign="top">I love the idea!  It seems to me the large diamond is supposed to be the star, but it doesn''t live up to the part somehow.  The highlight right above it definitely detracts.  I wish there was some refractive color in the large diamond, or some other striking highlight.  I''m actually surprised that just being the one thing in focus isn''t sufficient.</td>', 'I love the idea!  It seems to me the large diamond is supposed to be the star, but it doesn''t live up to the part somehow.  The highlight right above it definitely detracts.  I wish there was some refractive color in the large diamond, or some other striking highlight.  I''m actually surprised that just being the one thing in focus isn''t sufficient.', '2011-04-12 13:26:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6383775, 944582, 96751, '<td valign="top">Hahaha!  Very clever.  That one dark chip is disconcerting though.  Is it meant to be a wound of some sort?  Not sure it works...</td>', 'Hahaha!  Very clever.  That one dark chip is disconcerting though.  Is it meant to be a wound of some sort?  Not sure it works...', '2011-04-12 13:27:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6383776, 944829, 96751, '<td valign="top">Yeah, a ribbon.  You HAWG!!!<br/> <br/>:-)</td>', 'Yeah, a ribbon.  You HAWG!!! :-)', '2011-04-12 13:27:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6383777, 944650, 96751, '<td valign="top">Ha!  Your image and Wendy''s came up next to each other for me.  This is a real standout - very imaginative, and so nicely pp''d.  Love the colors.</td>', 'Ha!  Your image and Wendy''s came up next to each other for me.  This is a real standout - very imaginative, and so nicely pp''d.  Love the colors.', '2011-04-12 13:28:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6383779, 943772, 96751, '<td valign="top">NOT getting the chips reference here....  But a beautiful b/w.  Just wrong challenge.</td>', 'NOT getting the chips reference here....  But a beautiful b/w.  Just wrong challenge.', '2011-04-12 13:28:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6383780, 944904, 124256, '<td valign="top">I can''t tell what the chips are from, the pattern they are in doesn''t seem random to me, though their arrangement doesn''t say anything to me either.  Aside from that I think this is a well executed shot, I like the framing, and I think it is well balanced.  Looks good!</td>', 'I can''t tell what the chips are from, the pattern they are in doesn''t seem random to me, though their arrangement doesn''t say anything to me either.  Aside from that I think this is a well executed shot, I like the framing, and I think it is well balanced.  Looks good!', '2011-04-12 13:28:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6383788, 944890, 124256, '<td valign="top">Ah, I love the sense of motion this evokes.  The lighting, framing, focus are all superb.  Very nice shot!</td>', 'Ah, I love the sense of motion this evokes.  The lighting, framing, focus are all superb.  Very nice shot!', '2011-04-12 13:34:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6383809, 944397, 124256, '<td valign="top">I don''t know what it means!  Still, I like your shot and title.  Looks great, I like the dust or crumbs highlighting the horizontal line.  I think the chip would look lonelier with more negative space.</td>', 'I don''t know what it means!  Still, I like your shot and title.  Looks great, I like the dust or crumbs highlighting the horizontal line.  I think the chip would look lonelier with more negative space.', '2011-04-12 14:23:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6383810, 944847, 124256, '<td valign="top">I love the colors you captured here.  The look ready to fry up!</td>', 'I love the colors you captured here.  The look ready to fry up!', '2011-04-12 14:24:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6383811, 944582, 124256, '<td valign="top">This reminds me of the movie poster for Office Space, but it also makes me think of the movie Swamp Thing.  I can''t stop wondering if something just happened to the  monster, or if it is about to get up from a rest, or from being born.  I think more dramatic lighting or something to help make the atmosphere more eerie would be great.  Awesome idea and effort!</td>', 'This reminds me of the movie poster for Office Space, but it also makes me think of the movie Swamp Thing.  I can''t stop wondering if something just happened to the  monster, or if it is about to get up from a rest, or from being born.  I think more dramatic lighting or something to help make the atmosphere more eerie would be great.  Awesome idea and effort!', '2011-04-12 14:27:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6383814, 944908, 124256, '<td valign="top">Am I a wood chip that has been examined, and now having been tossed discarded, am flying towards the ground, a piece of debris?  Is this my last look at the world above, before I get buried by leaves and gradually decompose?  Nice shot!</td>', 'Am I a wood chip that has been examined, and now having been tossed discarded, am flying towards the ground, a piece of debris?  Is this my last look at the world above, before I get buried by leaves and gradually decompose?  Nice shot!', '2011-04-12 14:29:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6383817, 944910, 124256, '<td valign="top">I think this is technically a great shot.  To me it seems too much like a stock product shot and doesn''t impact me like I wish it would.</td>', 'I think this is technically a great shot.  To me it seems too much like a stock product shot and doesn''t impact me like I wish it would.', '2011-04-12 14:31:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6383858, 944754, 96751, '<td valign="top">Cool!</td>', 'Cool!', '2011-04-12 16:04:17.000000', NULL, 1),
