(6384376, 944485, 109363, '<td valign="top">THANK YOU TO ALL WHO VOTED AND MADE COMMENTS.<br/> <br/>Unfortunately, my photo was DQ''d.  I was using a loner camera because mine was in the shop for <br/>repairs after falling out of the camera bag.  I made the bonehead mistake of not checking to make <br/>sure the loner camera had the correct date... oh, yes, the month, day, and time were correct and <br/>within the challenge submission dates -- but it was set for 2010, not 2011.<br/> <br/>I thought I might have my first ribbon, but it wasn''t meant to be.  :-(<br/> <br/>-mefnj</td>', 'THANK YOU TO ALL WHO VOTED AND MADE COMMENTS. Unfortunately, my photo was DQ''d.  I was using a loner camera because mine was in the shop for repairs after falling out of the camera bag.  I made the bonehead mistake of not checking to make sure the loner camera had the correct date... oh, yes, the month, day, and time were correct and within the challenge submission dates -- but it was set for 2010, not 2011. I thought I might have my first ribbon, but it wasn''t meant to be.  :-( -mefnj', '2011-04-13 01:04:51.000000', NULL, 0),
