(6384391, 944582, 130694, '<td valign="top">Thank you for all the comments, I know that top right was pretty bad, I couldnt frame it any better as my daughter was freaking out from being still for so long. From what I read about the cropping rules there was really no real way for me to just crop it out, so I left it. I had fun with this and hope to do more :) so thank you all again!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2011-04-13 00:19:22.</i></td>', 'Thank you for all the comments, I know that top right was pretty bad, I couldnt frame it any better as my daughter was freaking out from being still for so long. From what I read about the cropping rules there was really no real way for me to just crop it out, so I left it. I had fun with this and hope to do more :) so thank you all again!', '2011-04-13 01:10:46.000000', '2011-04-13 01:19:22.000000', 0),
